WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,260
That Zhang Yi is too despicable

2
00:00:02,620 --> 00:00:04,620
They stabbed us with water pipes

3
00:00:05,100 --> 00:00:06,900
I can't stand it at all

4
00:00:07,860 --> 00:00:10,900
I don’t know how thick their door is. We smashed it for a long time.

5
00:00:10,900 --> 00:00:12,700
I just lost a little bit of energy.

6
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:18,080
I did feel it when I went up there

7
00:00:18,080 --> 00:00:19,880
The door of Zhang Yi’s house is very thick

8
00:00:20,400 --> 00:00:22,630
It seems that it is difficult to attack by force.

9
00:00:26,880 --> 00:00:28,000
It doesn't matter

10
00:00:28,440 --> 00:00:30,160
Even if their family is iron

11
00:00:30,160 --> 00:00:31,600
There will always be flaws

12
00:00:31,920 --> 00:00:33,400
And I don't believe it

13
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:34,520
He can last a lifetime

14
00:00:34,520 --> 00:00:36,240
Stay at home and don't come out

15
00:00:36,560 --> 00:00:38,160
A few of you are standing guard nearby.

16
00:00:38,160 --> 00:00:39,280
As soon as he goes out

17
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,400
Take action immediately

18
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:46,500
Although I know this guy

19
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:47,700
Won't give up

20
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:50,020
But they don't have that ability either

21
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,260
break into one's own home

22
00:00:52,120 --> 00:00:53,120
As for going out

23
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:55,240
I would never make this choice.

24
00:00:56,150 --> 00:00:58,150
Even if there is only one ten thousandth risk

25
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:01,990
I won't even risk it

26
00:01:02,500 --> 00:01:04,540
It’s so comfortable to be a dog at home

27
00:01:04,860 --> 00:01:05,780
Isn’t it delicious?
